# Employee Survey Assignment

This repository contains my Employee Survey Assignment completed in RStudio.

## Contents
- R Markdown file containing the analysis
- HTML output generated from the R Markdown file
- Employee survey dataset

## Analysis Included
- Renaming and exploring variables
- Converting categorical variables to factors
- Five-number summaries and descriptive statistics
- Boxplots, histograms, bar charts, and scatter plots
- Examination of relationships between employee survey variables

## Tools Used
- R
- RStudio
- R Markdown
